terms.medium_def:
A man from the tribe of Levi living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Sa.1.1; 
referred to as Tohu (תֹּחוּ), or Nahath (נַ֫חַת), or Toah (תּוֹחַ); 
a son of Zuph; 
father of Elihu. § son of Zuph, father of Eliel, and ancestor of Samuel and Heman

